 "_source": "Table of Contents FRT, AK's own transcription of the ten-volume Tunis 2022 printing (Majmaʿ al-Yamāma). Google Drive folder 1sKaOuyOODK4ouWtB588VFSbt5MRSwUgt. Pagination restarts at p. 3 in every volume, so a volume number is required with every page.",
 "_caveats": [
  "Volume 3 lists Lesson 18 and Sūrat al-Aʿrāf at the same page (191). AK's own transcription flags this as a possible artifact; unverified against the physical copy.",
  "Sūra start pages are where the sūra's HEADING appears, not where its commentary begins in the lesson sequence — a lesson can open mid-sūra.",
  "Volume 10 gives al-Kawthar p. 213 and al-Kāfirūn p. 220, a seven-page gap for a three-verse sūra. Plausible (an excursus) but worth a glance."
